## Quick Reference

### All Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|--------|----------|------|-------------|
| GET | `/health` | No | Health check |
| GET | `/api/users` | Yes | List all users |
| GET | `/api/users/:id` | Yes | Get single user |
| POST | `/api/users` | Yes | Create user |
| PUT | `/api/users/:id` | Yes | Update user |
| DELETE | `/api/users/:id` | Yes | Delete user |
| GET | `/api/posts` | No | List all posts |
| GET | `/api/posts/:id` | No | Get single post |
| POST | `/api/posts` | Yes | Create post |
| PUT | `/api/posts/:id` | Yes | Update post |
| DELETE | `/api/posts/:id` | Yes | Delete post |
| POST | `/api/uploads` | Yes | Upload file |
| GET | `/api/uploads/:id` | Yes | Get upload info |
| DELETE | `/api/uploads/:id` | Yes | Delete upload |

